          <change when="2014-10-11T11:18:30.455-04:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/ngonis">BL corrections incorporated into lines 3, 7, 14, 26, 28-29 that I've been able to verify (NB line 14, Τοκώε[ως, not Τοκωέ[ως.). Those recorded in BL VIII 390 are conjectures, and are either wrong or dubious; I also have doubts about the one on line 12 (BL III 219). It should be noted that the rendering of line 29 (line not reported in ed. pr.) in BL VII 230 is a compromise; Bagnall–Worp, ZPE 28 (1978) 221, wrote, "as there are in fact traces below this line, we may suppose that the date continued, giving at least the month and day, and in all likelihood preceding that, τῶν λαμπροτάτων."</change>
